    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1241630/extras/314b56f845a9c15671bcb81676d9b669.avif?t=1731440407\" /></div><br>Glitch out of reality! Master rocket-powered jumps, dashes, and rolls to save your town from pixelized foes bursting from busted game consoles in this bonkers 2D action adventure!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Enjoy a blend of exploration, platforming, and enemy encounters.<br></li><li>Find secrets, collectible items, and fulfil the objectives of each area.<br></li><li>Explore the city in between adventures.<br></li><li>Interact with a colorful cast of characters and obtain key items to help you on your journey.<br></li><li>Collect power-ups you can equip to greatly enhance your abilities.<br></li><li>Jump on enemies to deal maximum damage and create combos.<br></li><li>Use your &quot;Pocket M8&quot; companion to blast away foes with powerful weapons.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1241630/extras/314b56f845a9c15671bcb81676d9b669.avif?t=1731440407\" /></div><br>Glitch out of reality! Master rocket-powered jumps, dashes, and rolls to save your town from pixelized foes bursting from busted game consoles in this bonkers 2D action adventure!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Enjoy a blend of exploration, platforming, and enemy encounters.<br></li><li>Find secrets, collectible items, and fulfil the objectives of each area.<br></li><li>Explore the city in between adventures.<br></li><li>Interact with a colorful cast of characters and obtain key items to help you on your journey.<br></li><li>Collect power-ups you can equip to greatly enhance your abilities.<br></li><li>Jump on enemies to deal maximum damage and create combos.<br></li><li>Use your &quot;Pocket M8&quot; companion to blast away foes with powerful weapons.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Glitch out of reality! Master rocket-powered jumps, dashes, and rolls to save your town from pixelized foes bursting from busted game consoles in this bonkers 2D action adventure!",
